### PART 8 — BACKEND SERVER TECHNOLOGY

### 19\. Recommended Backend Stack

* Firebase Authentication – Student, Teacher, Admin, Parent Login

* Cloud Firestore – Student and Institute Database

* Firebase Storage – Student Photos, Documents, Certificates

* Firebase Cloud Messaging – Notifications

* Firebase App Check – Application Protection

* Cloud Functions – Secure Server Operations

* Cloud Run – Dedicated Backend Services

* Cloud SQL PostgreSQL – Structured Relational Data if required

* Memorystore Redis – Optional Server-side Caching

* Google Cloud Monitoring – Backend Monitoring

Important: Firestore alone can support a large application, but a dedicated backend may be required for advanced business logic, reporting, bulk operations, and complex processing.

